  "details": "Request:\n\nA component that measures current velocity in meters per second and outputs as a float, and updates really quickly.\n\nMore info:\n\nThis could be used as a more reliable method to trigger things based on speed of a moving object than using physbone stretch, as physbone stretch takes time to snap back in place, and seems to be smoothed somewhat.\n\nPossible use-cases:\n\n- Swing activated effects for weapons such as swords\n\n- Animation speed control for things such as followers",
